  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.2.0 Ports the apexsankey 1.11.0 option surface into the C# model: type (chord), arcCornerRadius, theme (named or inline SankeyTheme) and nodePalette, orientation, whitespace, axisTitles, viewPortWidth/Height, draggableNodes, particleFlow, nodeTooltipTemplate, tooltipTheme, tooltipFontColor, and a11y. Adds a Plugins option to install the built-in path tracing, time playback, and drill-down plugins. Non-breaking over 1.1.0.",
